# Test of the War Spirit (Q233), played by a level 39 Orc Shaman who already holds the trophies the
# kills below do not give (part of the Tonar and Hermodt bones, nine of each of Orim's three
# trophies, eleven Tamlin orc heads), every script roll pinned: Somak starts it and pays the level
# 39 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Orim's contract and the three trophies make Braki's remains;
# Racoy's totem, Vivyan's letter, Sarien's diagram and the noble ants' bones make Kiruna's; the
# Leto lizardmen's bones make Tonar's through Pekiron; Manakia's totem and Medusa and Stenoa's
# bones make Hermodt's; Somak takes the four remains for the vendetta totem, the Tamlin orcs'
# heads complete it and Somak turns it into the second remains and the war spirit totem;
# Ancestor Martankus takes them for the Mark of War Spirit; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
